{"id":"607607","name":"荷包蛋焖荞麦面","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/607607/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"荞麦面","amount":"一个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:荞麦面，鸡蛋。","img":"images/607607/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"葱花。","img":"images/607607/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅放油，先煎荷包蛋，嘿嘿两黄哦。","img":"images/607607/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"两面煮煎一下。","img":"images/607607/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量的水。","img":"images/607607/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入荞麦面，辣豆瓣酱一勺。","img":"images/607607/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"红烧酱油少许。","img":"images/607607/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上盖子中火焖煮约三分钟。","img":"images/607607/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"打开盖子收干汁即可。","img":"images/607607/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盛上碗放点葱花完成了。","img":"images/607607/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/607607/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/607607/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}